---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { frontmatter as SITE } from "../data/home.md";
---

<Layout title={"About — " + SITE.name} description="About n0qword">
<h1>About</h1>
<p class="page-desc">
  <span class="count">01</span> &nbsp;who's behind this
</p>
<p>
  I'm <strong>Adrian Medero</strong>, also known as <strong>n0qword</strong> — a security
  researcher and computer enthusiast. I've always been curious about what happens beneath
  the surface of the machines we use, taking things apart and following the rabbit hole
  until I understand how they really work.
</p>
<p>
  That curiosity eventually led me to security research, where I spend most of my time
  exploring systems, breaking things, and learning how they can be made to do things they
  weren't meant to do. This blog is where I document that journey and share the things
  I learn along the way.
</p>
<p>
  I believe knowledge becomes more valuable when it's shared. When I'm not researching,
  you'll probably find me in a lab, building something, or getting lost in another
  rabbit hole.
</p>
  <h2>contact</h2>
  <div class="social-links">
    <a href={SITE.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">github</a>
    <span class="social-sep">/</span>
    <a href={SITE.twitter} target="_blank" rel="noopener">twitter</a>
    <span class="social-sep">/</span>
    <a href={SITE.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener">linkedin</a>
    <span class="social-sep">/</span>
    <a href={"mailto:" + SITE.mail}>mail</a>
  </div>
</Layout>
